{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Operator ruling 2026-09-08: Option 1 approved — add docker-storage-cap.sh and journald-cap.sh to both OBS_PATHS and MATERIALIZER_PATHS, and teach check_deploy_manifest.py to derive *-cap.sh scripts automatically so future cap scripts cannot be omitted. No new CAP_PATHS mechanism (mechanism-ratchet: prefer existing sets). Per ADR 0112 operator-settable caps must deploy when changed."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788910463322737001,"uuid":"1574e604-9ef1-457a-af5c-700d95fbc0cd"}